WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:06.441
Jack is looking for Polly's ball.

2
00:00:06.442 --> 00:00:08.985
How kind of him!

3
00:00:08.986 --> 00:00:19.241
But what's Polly

4
