doing? Polly: Where's

5
00:00:21.398 --> 00:00:23.983
Jack? I need my ball back—now!

6
00:00:23.984 --> 00:00:37.034
I'll look for it too. Oh!

7
00:00:37.035 --> 00:00:47.384
A pond—and a frog. Frog:

8
00:00:47.385 --> 00:00:50.033
Is this yours? Polly:

9
00:00:50.034 --> 00:00:52.385
My ball! You found it! Throw

10
